Record a core-issued producer grant for a core-owned fact kind

Usage:
  eshu component grant <producer-id> [flags]

Flags:
      --component-home string    Component registry home directory
      --expires-in duration      Grant lifetime from issuance, for example 720h
  -h, --help                     help for grant
      --json                     Write stable JSON output
      --kind string              Core-owned fact kind the producer may emit
      --schema-version strings   Covered fact schema version; repeat for multiple versions
      --scope string             Source scope the grant is valid for
      --version string           Granted manifest version to bind

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
